-----WEBSCRAPING---
->Web Scraping is the process of automatically extracting data from websites using a program instead of copying the information manually.

LIBRARY
->requests-used to download the webpage from the internet 
->BeautifulSoup-used to read and understand the HTML that requests downloaded

APPLICATION
1. E-commerce (Price Comparison) 🛒
2. Travel Websites ✈️
3. Job Portals 💼
4. News Aggregators 📰
5. Movie Recommendation

USER AGENT
->not all the website prove the permision for webscraping 
->they can block a request 
-> so we use user agent
